# Predictive Analytics Using Historical Data

## Project Overview
This project builds a predictive modeling pipeline to forecast future trends based on historical data. 

## Workflow Implemented
1. **Data Preprocessing:** Cleaned historical datasets, handled missing data, and structured time-series indices.
2. **Modeling:** Implemented a Linear Regression model to identify and project long-term data trends.
3. **Evaluation:** Evaluated model performance using Mean Absolute Error (MAE) and R-squared metrics.

